        {
          "say": "Vega can read this service’s evaluation metrics under a scoped grant. Promoting the reranker needs human review because users would see different results. Disabling a required safety filter needs stronger review. A public release note also needs approval before it reaches its audience.",
          "start": 0.4,
          "end": 19.084999999999997,
          "duration": 18.685,
          "until": 19.984999999999996
        },
        {
          "say": "Now keep the promotion tool, service and reviewer policy fixed. The weekday rule sends targets above twenty-five percent to a senior reviewer. Vega’s original target sits exactly on that line. Increase the target to fifty percent. The call crosses the threshold and needs senior review.",
          "start": 19.984999999999996,
          "end": 39.090958,
          "duration": 19.105958,
          "until": 39.940957999999995
        },
        {
          "say": "The minimum review level for an action is its policy floor. A model can flag an anomaly or help a reviewer decide which packet to open first. The host enforces that floor before it lets an effect reach users.",
          "start": 39.940957999999995,
          "end": 53.63095799999999,
          "duration": 13.69,
          "until": 54.530958
        }
      ],
