      "beats": [
        {
          "say": "Here is the packet the host saved. Vega wants twenty-five percent of live traffic on reranker seventeen, starting from shadow at deployment revision three. The run and evaluation references travel with the proposal. The host serializes these fields and hashes those bytes. The short fingerprint stands for the full digest.",
          "start": 0.4,
          "end": 21.305957999999997,
          "duration": 20.905958,
          "until": 22.005957999999996
        },
        {
          "say": "Casey signs in and clicks Approve. Her click is pending. The decision service checks her role and tenant, the packet version and the deadline. Once she qualifies, it saves her approval and the full digest together in a protected record.",
          "start": 22.005957999999996,
          "end": 37.24095799999999,
          "duration": 15.235,
          "until": 37.99095799999999
        },
        {
          "say": "Start the worker with the same packet. Its fingerprint matches. Now change just the working copy to ten percent. Would Casey’s saved decision cover that smaller canary?",
          "start": 37.99095799999999,
          "end": 49.22595799999999,
          "duration": 11.235,
          "until": 51.425957999999994
        },
        {
          "say": "It covers twenty-five percent. The worker’s ten percent gives a different digest. Three of the proposed shares disappeared from the working copy. The host keeps Casey’s decision with the original bytes and sends the edit through policy as a new proposal. To judge the ranking itself, Casey can open the evaluation linked in the packet.",
          "start": 51.425957999999994,
          "end": 72.155958,
          "duration": 20.73,
          "until": 73.05595799999999
        }
      ],
